# Bonecache Overseer {B} (1/1): "Activate only if three or more cards left your graveyard this turn or if you've sacrificed a Food
# this turn." On turn 1 Bot1 casts the Overseer and a City Pigeon, then Lightning Bolts the Pigeon: its leave trigger makes a Food.
# On turn 3 the Overseer is refused with the Food merely on the battlefield; once Bot1 sacrifices the Food ({2}, {T}, gain 3 life)
# the Overseer may draw, paying 1 life. Nothing left the graveyard (the Pigeon and Bolt stay there), so it is the Food that counts.

